# detail
Number of changes: 1

1. Modified | Implementation code block
   Replaced the original index-expression construction and `_pyexpr.take` call with directly returning `self.gather(indices)`.
   The original implementation included:

   * Conditional statement: according to whether `indices` was a `list` or `np.ndarray`, generate `indices_lit` through `F.lit(pl.Series(...))._pyexpr` or `parse_as_expression(indices)`;
   * Return statement: call `self._from_pyexpr(self._pyexpr.take(indices_lit))`.

   The new implementation includes:

   * Return statement: call `self.gather(indices)`.
